      "text": "Two Paris Métro lines cross Boulogne‑Billancourt: Line 9 stops at Marcel Sembat, Billancourt, and Pont de Sèvres, while Line 10 serves Boulogne‑Jean Jaurès and Boulogne‑Pont de Saint‑Cloud.",
